---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const effective = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — Web Guy Nick LLC"
  description="How Web Guy Nick LLC uses affiliate links, including Amazon Associates (tag: webguynick-20) and hosting referrals via link.me/webguynick."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-16 pb-24 prose-custom">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-5xl">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> {effective}</p>

    <p>
      Web Guy Nick LLC participates in affiliate programs, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Amazon Associates.</strong> As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases. Our affiliate tag is <code>webguynick-20</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting referrals</strong> via <a href="https://link.me/webguynick">link.me/webguynick</a> and related programs with hosting vendors we review on this Site.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      When you click an affiliate link on this Site and complete a purchase or sign-up, Web Guy Nick LLC
      may receive a commission. <strong>This is at no additional cost to you.</strong> The price you pay, and
      any promotional pricing you qualify for, is unchanged by the use of an affiliate link.
    </p>

    <p>
      We only recommend products and services we believe provide real value to small businesses.
      Affiliate compensation does not determine our reviews or rankings — but we believe transparency
      matters, which is why we clearly mark affiliate outbound links with <code>rel="nofollow sponsored"</code>
      and publish this page.
    </p>

    <p>
      Questions about this disclosure? Email <a href="mailto:info@webguynick.com">info@webguynick.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
